#: ckanext/datapackager/logic/action/update.py:37
msgid ""
"Data Package: At least one resource with URL is required to create a Data"
" Package. The Data Package will be deleted if it exists."
msgstr "Data Package: 必須至少有一個具有網址的資源以建立 Data Package，已存在的 Data Package 將被刪除"

#: ckanext/datapackager/logic/action/update.py:51
msgid ""
"Data Package: Only datasets with a total resource size of {0} MB or less "
"are supported to create a Data Package. The Data Package will be deleted "
"if it exists."
msgstr ""
"Data Package: 僅資源大小合計小於或等於 {} MB 的資料集可建立 Data Package，已存在的 Data Package "
"將被刪除"

#: ckanext/datapackager/logic/action/update.py:68
msgid ""
"The Data Package doesn't need an update as its metadata and resources "
"haven't changed: {}"
msgstr "此 Data Package 無需更新，因為後設資料與資源均未變更：{}"

