#: ckanext/datapackager/templates/datapackage/import_datapackage.html:12
msgid "What are Data Packages?"
msgstr "Data Packages 是什麼？"

#: ckanext/datapackager/templates/datapackage/import_datapackage.html:15
msgid ""
"A <a href=\"https://datapackage.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Data Package</a>"
" is a simple container format used to describe and package a collection "
"of data."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://datapackage.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Data Package</a> "
"是一種簡單的容器格式，可用來描述與封裝一批資料。"

#: ckanext/datapackager/templates/datapackage/import_datapackage.html:22
msgid ""
"You can import Data Packages to create CKAN datasets. The options "
"supported are:"
msgstr "您可以匯入 Data Packages 以建立 CKAN 資料集。支援以下方式："

#: ckanext/datapackager/templates/datapackage/import_datapackage.html:25
msgid ""
"Upload or link to a Data Package descriptor (<i>datapackage.json</i> "
"file) that references data files hosted elsewhere."
msgstr "上傳或連結到位於他處的 Data Package 描述檔（<i>datapackage.json</i> 檔案）"

#: ckanext/datapackager/templates/datapackage/import_datapackage.html:28
msgid ""
"Upload a zipped Data Package that includes the data files, plus a Data "
"Package descriptor (<i>datapackage.json</i> file) in the root of the ZIP "
"file."
msgstr ""
"上傳 Data Package ZIP 壓縮檔，包含資料檔案以及 Data Package 描述檔（<i>datapackage.json</i>"
" 檔案，置於壓縮檔根目錄）"

